cos00:- true | cos00(3.141592654).
cos00(X):- Z$:=cos(X) | cos00ans(Z).
otherwise.
cos00(_):- put_console(c#"*") | cos01.
cos00ans(Z):- -1.0-1.0e-5$<Z, Z$< -1.0+1.0e-5, put_console(c#"a") | cos01.
otherwise.
cos00ans(_):- put_console(c#"*") | cos01.

